&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_e22f7fa58049e8c4-79&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Deep experience selling Security, SaaS, AI or Software solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
