&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_e22f7fa58049e8c4-80&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0,0&quot;&gt;A proven ability to work with Channel partners to co-develop pipeline, create joint plans, and lead opportunities to closure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
