&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leader, Private Equity Relations &amp;amp; Engagement&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team. This is a Remote (US, preferably Northeast US or NYC metro area) role, reporting to the Global Private Equity Practice Leader in the Mergers &amp;amp; Acquisitions&amp;nbsp; department. The Strategic Leader, Private Equity Relations &amp;amp; Engagement builds and drives strategic engagements with key Private Equity (PE) partners to accelerate cyber resiliency, improve EBITDA, and mitigate risk across portfolio companies using the Zscaler Zero Trust platform. Serving as the primary point of contact for PE partners, this role orchestrates value selling, deal structuring, and cross-functional expert teams to demonstrate the impact of technology on investment theses. Through strategic relationship management and operational execution, you will originate pipeline opportunities, conduct performance reviews, and accelerate enterprise digital transformation across portfolio investments.&lt;/p&gt;
