&lt;p&gt;As a Coinbase Concierge on the Customer Experience team, you&#39;ll serve as the primary relationship owner and subject matter expert for our highest-value customers, delivering world-class service that makes using Coinbase seamless and intuitive. This team is the frontline for building trust with the customers who matter most to our business. You&#39;ll own the full customer lifecycle, from onboarding and account setup through ongoing education and proactive issue resolution, directly shaping how our most valued customers experience every Coinbase product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deepen relationships with a portfolio of high-value Consumer customers, serving as their primary point of contact and trusted advisor across all Coinbase products and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end onboarding for new customers, helping them understand how to set up, secure, fund, and begin using their accounts based on their individual goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor customer accounts proactively to identify potential issues before they escalate, resolving them directly or guiding the customer to a resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
