&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end resolution of customer inquiries across phone, messaging, and email channels by investigating, troubleshooting, and solving issues on first contact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive accurate issue tracking and defect logging to surface systemic problems and inform upstream product and process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate customers proactively on Coinbase products and features, setting clear expectations and adding value in every interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams to escalate, resolve, and close out complex cases that require coordination beyond frontline support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead by example within the Customer Support organization by consistently meeting or exceeding performance benchmarks and quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in customer support within financial services, crypto, fintech, or a technology platform, including multi-channel support (phone, messaging, and email).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to investigate and resolve complex customer issues independently, with a track record of high first-contact resolution rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in support tooling such as Salesforce Service Cloud, JIRA, Amazon Connect, or similar CRM and ticketing platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in written and spoken English with the ability to communicate clearly across global teams and diverse customer populations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to work rotating shifts, weekends, and holidays from the Manila, Philippines office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PID - P78900&lt;/p&gt;
