&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; is building the future of finance for people, institutions and their agents, with one place to trade crypto, equities, derivatives and prediction markets, use stablecoins, and connect AI agents with clear controls. The bar is high and the pace is intense, and we like it that way. This isn’t a place for complacency. It’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits and do the best work of your career. If you’re ready to build the future of finance with a championship team who refuse to settle for “good enough,” you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for in-person working sessions&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IT Tier 2 Support Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As an ITSS In-Office Support Engineer on our IT Team, you&#39;ll be the hands-on technology partner keeping our London office running smoothly every day. This team is the front line of IT support at Coinbase, owning hardware, software, and collaboration infrastructure across our global offices. You&#39;ll troubleshoot issues in real time, manage onboarding and off-boarding workflows, and drive improvements that make every employee&#39;s experience faster and more reliable.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day technical support for the London office, resolving hardware, software, networking, and AV/conference room issues across macOS, iOS, Chrome OS, Windows, and Android platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive onboarding and offboarding operations end to end, ensuring every new hire is productive on Day 1 and every departure is handled securely and efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and improve IT documentation, including setup guides, troubleshooting runbooks, and knowledge base articles that keep pace with live systems and evolving tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with IT Procurement and local vendors to coordinate hardware logistics, supply chain processes, and office technology refresh cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead first-line network and AV troubleshooting, triaging issues to specialized teams with clear diagnostics and context to accelerate resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute on IT Operations scrum team projects, contributing to initiatives that scale support capabilities and reduce manual effort across the global service desk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years in IT support, service desk, or endpoint engineering with hands-on experience supporting macOS, iOS, Chrome OS, Windows, and Android in a corporate environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency administering SaaS platforms including Google Workspace, Atlassian (Jira Service Management), Okta, Jamf, and Slack, with the ability to troubleshoot access, provisioning, and integration issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mid-level networking knowledge including TCP/IP, DNS, DHCP, and Wi-Fi troubleshooting, with the ability to isolate connectivity issues and escalate with actionable diagnostics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated root cause analysis methodology, with a track record of identifying recurring issues and driving systemic fixes rather than repeat break-fix cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating with service vendors and IT procurement teams to manage hardware logistics, office buildouts, or supply chain workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt; The target annual &lt;strong&gt;base&lt;/strong&gt; salary for this position can range as detailed below. Total compensation may&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;also include equity and bonus eligibility and benefits (including medical, dental, and vision).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£58,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£58,800 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
