&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;2+ years of professional experience in machine learning and software engineering, with experience shipping production-grade ML services.&lt;/p&gt;
