&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Working knowledge in at least one domain such as NLP, information retrieval, computer vision, or statistical modeling.&lt;/p&gt;
