&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We’re hiring a Marketplace Deal Operations Analyst to become the hands-on expert in cloud marketplace transactions (AWS, Azure and GCP) for our EMEA business.&amp;nbsp;This role takes the operational detail of lower segment marketplace deals off Deal Desk Analysts and Field sellers, so they can focus on strategy, structuring and higher-value deals.&amp;nbsp;It is a distinct function from Deal Desk Analyst: a specialist execution and process-ownership role for someone who wants to go deep on marketplace mechanics, build genuine subject-matter expertise, and bring order to a high-volume, detail-heavy process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy being the person everyone turns to for the right answer, and you take pride in getting every detail right at speed, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CET business hours (approx. 1:30pm–10:30pm IST in winter, 12:30pm–9:30pm IST in summer)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executing marketplace transactions at high velocity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate, submit and manage private offers across AWS Marketplace, Azure Marketplace and Google Cloud Marketplace for EMEA deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end execution of marketplace transactions: validating deal requirements, ensuring documentation accuracy, and processing offers against defined SLAs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process amendments, renewals and cancellations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Becoming the marketplace expert&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the go-to subject-matter expert on operational marketplace processes across all three hyperscalers for the EMEA organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot process gaps and create clear, repeatable guidance (SOPs, checklists and playbooks) so Field and Deal Desk can self-serve where possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on program and process changes from AWS, Azure and GCP, and turn them into updated internal guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supporting Deal Desk and Field&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on administrative support on marketplace transactions to Deal Desk Analysts and EMEA Field sellers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve ad-hoc operational issues and one-off transaction challenges as they arise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the first point of contact for “how do I handle this marketplace scenario?” transactional process questions from the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growing into Deal Desk&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over time, build working knowledge of broader Deal Desk processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ad-hoc deal support to the Deal Desk team when volume or complexity requires it, as a development opportunity rather than a core responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct, hands-on experience with cloud marketplace transactions (AWS, Azure and/or GCP Marketplace) in a B2B SaaS environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a high-velocity SaaS company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment in nuanced, non-templated scenarios. This is not a pure checklist-following role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail, with accuracy in documentation and process treated as non-negotiable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organization and analytical skills, with the ability to manage a high volume of concurrent, detail-heavy transactions without anything slipping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with repeatable, high-volume work, and an understanding that transaction volume will fluctuate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The confidence to ask questions and surface ambiguity rather than guess silently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ambition and motivation to provide excellent support to a field sales organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal English communication skills, as you’ll work daily with EMEA Field and Deal Desk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce (or a similar CRM) and a CPQ tool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience supporting a field sales organization in a support or operations capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS Partner accreditation, Azure Marketplace certification, or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a shared-services or GCC model supporting a Western HQ or the EMEA region specifically&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
